# 📌 Expected Outcome

The proposed system will provide an intelligent constitutional assistant capable of answering Bangladesh Constitution-related questions by integrating:

- Deep Learning
- Natural Language Processing
- Transformer Models
- Semantic Search
- Knowledge Retrieval

The system aims to make constitutional information more accessible while maintaining accuracy through context-based generation.

